OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies remember teens who died
OL,4,Ain river
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe families of two teenagers who died
OL,7,Fwhen the car they were in ended up in a
OL,8,Friver have paid tribute to their
OL,9,Fkindness and "zest for life".
OL,11,FSixteen-year-olds Luke Etheridge and
OL,12,FZara Shaw died along with Jackson Duke,
OL,13,F17, when the black Audi A3 they were in
OL,14,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,15,FWearmouth Bridge, Sunderland, and
OL,16,Fplunged into the Wear just before 13:30
OL,17,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,19,FLuke's family said the Sunderland fan
OL,20,Fwas caring and loved their dog Wilf,
OL,21,Fadding their hearts would "ache
OL,22,Fforever".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
